    "detailed_description": "Digital Creative Framework (DCF): Build Your Digital Imagination<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout This Game<br />\r\nStep into the Digital Creative Framework (DCF), a groundbreaking world-building platform powered by Unreal Engine 5.4.4. With DCF, you are the architect of immersive digital realms, equipped with tools that let you create, customize, and share your worlds.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udf0d Gameplay Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTerraforming Made Easy: Sculpt landscapes, raise mountains, carve rivers, and transform the environment to match your vision.<br />\r\nModular Building System: Design and construct detailed structures with intuitive snapping and placement tools.<br />\r\nShare Your Creations: Publish your worlds on the DCF Workshop, where others can explore, play, and remix your ideas.<br />\r\nWhether you're a solo creator crafting your dream realm or a team building together, DCF empowers you to bring your imagination to life.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfae Core Gameplay:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSurvive, Build, Explore: Create playable survival maps.<br />\r\nSandbox Freedom: Focus on creativity and exploration without constraints.<br />\r\nExperience the ultimate platform where imagination is the only limit. Your world, your rules. Start building today!",
    "about_the_game": "Digital Creative Framework (DCF): Build Your Digital Imagination<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout This Game<br />\r\nStep into the Digital Creative Framework (DCF), a groundbreaking world-building platform powered by Unreal Engine 5.4.4. With DCF, you are the architect of immersive digital realms, equipped with tools that let you create, customize, and share your worlds.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udf0d Gameplay Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTerraforming Made Easy: Sculpt landscapes, raise mountains, carve rivers, and transform the environment to match your vision.<br />\r\nModular Building System: Design and construct detailed structures with intuitive snapping and placement tools.<br />\r\nShare Your Creations: Publish your worlds on the DCF Workshop, where others can explore, play, and remix your ideas.<br />\r\nWhether you're a solo creator crafting your dream realm or a team building together, DCF empowers you to bring your imagination to life.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfae Core Gameplay:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSurvive, Build, Explore: Create playable survival maps.<br />\r\nSandbox Freedom: Focus on creativity and exploration without constraints.<br />\r\nExperience the ultimate platform where imagination is the only limit. Your world, your rules. Start building today!",
    "short_description": "Digital Creative Framework (DCF) is a sandbox platform for building and sharing custom worlds. Sculpt terrain, design structures, and add AI-driven mechanics. Play solo or collaborate in multiplayer to explore limitless creativity and immersive gameplay.",
